@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### My notifications (meta.unreadCount = total unread)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Only the unread ones
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications?unread=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark one as read
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark all as read
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
